    "[**Alexandru Cristescu**](https:\/\/github.com\/acristescu), for creating the [**Sente**](https:\/\/github.com\/acristescu\/OnlineGo) Android app for OGS and making it open source. The process of creating this Android app, along with the project itself have been great reference materials for me during development." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Alexandru Cristescu**](https:\/\/github.com\/acristescu), pour la création du client OGS open-source [**Sente**](https:\/\/github.com\/acristescu\/OnlineGo) pour Android. Le procédé de création de cette application ainsi que du projet en tant que tel ont étés une précieuse aide pour moi pendant le développement."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[「**Sente**」](https:\/\/github.com\/acristescu\/OnlineGo) というAndroid用アプリを作り、オープンソースで提供してくれて、[**Alexandru Cristescu**](https:\/\/github.com\/acristescu)にありがとうございます。このAndroidアプリのプロジェクトはSurroundの開発には大変参考なりました。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OGS용 [**Sente**](https:\/\/github.com\/acristescu\/OnlineGo) Android 앱을 만들고 오픈 소스로 공개하여 개발에 훌륭한 참고 자료를 제공해 준 [**Alexandru Cristescu**](https:\/\/github.com\/acristescu)에게 감사드립니다."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Alexandru Cristescu**](https:\/\/github.com\/acristescu), tác giả của ứng dụng mã nguồn mở [**Sente**](https:\/\/github.com\/acristescu\/OnlineGo) cho Android. Trong quá trình phát triển Surround đã có tham khảo rất nhiều từ Sente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感谢 [**Alexandru Cristescu**](https:\/\/github.com\/acristescu) 为 OGS 开发并开源 [**Sente**](https:\/\/github.com\/acristescu\/OnlineGo) Android 应用。该应用的开发过程和项目本身都为我的开发工作提供了宝贵参考。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Alexandru Cristescu**](https:\/\/github.com\/acristescu)，感謝他開發並開源 OGS Android 應用程式 [**Sente**](https:\/\/github.com\/acristescu\/OnlineGo)。這款 Android 應用程式的開發過程與專案本身，在 Surround 開發期間提供了寶貴的參考。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "[**Linh Pham**](https:\/\/linhpham.me), for creating the app icon, and providing design advises for the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Linh Pham**](https:\/\/linhpham.me), pour la création de l'icône de l'application et pour ses conseils de conception."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アップ・アイコンの作成とデザインのご相談は、[**Linh Pham**](https:\/\/linhpham.me)さんにご提供いいただきました。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앱 아이콘을 만들고 디자인 조언을 제공해 준 [**Linh Pham**](https:\/\/linhpham.me)에게 감사드립니다."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Linh Pham**](https:\/\/linhpham.me), người thiết kế biểu tượng ứng dụng và hỗ trợ tư vấn thiết kế cho Surround."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感谢 [**Linh Pham**](https:\/\/linhpham.me) 设计本应用的图标，并提供设计建议。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Linh Pham**](https:\/\/linhpham.me)，感謝他設計應用程式圖示，並提供設計建議。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "[**Raphaël Assenat**](https:\/\/www.raphnet.net\/index_en.php), for kickstarting the effort to translate this app to multiple languages, and for translating the app to Japanese." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Raphaël Assenat**](https:\/\/www.raphnet.net\/index_en.php), for kickstarting the effort to translate this app to multiple languages, and for translating the app to Japanese and French."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Raphaël Assenat**](https:\/\/www.raphnet.net\/index_en.php), pour la mise en branle de l'effort de traduction de l'application en plusieurs langues ainsi que pour les traductions japonaise et française."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Raphaël Assenat**](https:\/\/www.raphnet.net\/index_en.php)は、このアプリの翻訳を開始して、日本語とフランス語の翻訳を提供しました。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "다국어 번역을 시작하고 일본어와 프랑스어 번역을 제공해 준 [**Raphaël Assenat**](https:\/\/www.raphnet.net\/index_en.php)에게 감사드립니다."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Raphaël Assenat**](https:\/\/www.raphnet.net\/index_en.php), người bắt đầu quá trình dịch Surround ra các ngôn ngữ khác, và giúp dịch Surround sang tiếng Nhật và tiếng Pháp."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感谢 [**Raphaël Assenat**](https:\/\/www.raphnet.net\/index_en.php) 推动本应用的多语言翻译工作，并完成日语翻译。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Raphaël Assenat**](https:\/\/www.raphnet.net\/index_en.php)，感謝他推動本應用程式的多語系翻譯，並完成日文與法文翻譯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "[**The OGS Team**](https:\/\/online-go.com\/docs\/team), for creating and maintaining an excellent Go Server with open API, and for all the support during the development of the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**L'équipe d'OGS**](https:\/\/online-go.com\/docs\/team), pour la creation et la maintenance d'un excellent serveur de Go à API ouverte, et pour le support lors du développement de l'application."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オープンAPIを使った素晴らしい囲碁サーバーを作り、そしてこのアプリの開発に大事なサポートもしてくれて、[**OGSチーム**](https:\/\/online-go.com\/docs\/team)には大変ありがとうございます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "개방형 API를 갖춘 훌륭한 바둑 서버를 만들고 운영하며 앱 개발을 도와준 [**OGS 팀**](https:\/\/online-go.com\/docs\/team)에게 감사드립니다."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Đội ngũ OGS**](https:\/\/online-go.com\/docs\/team), những người tạo ra, duy trì website OGS, và hỗ trợ quá trình phát triển Surround."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感谢 [**OGS 团队**](https:\/\/online-go.com\/docs\/team) 创建并维护提供开放 API 的优秀围棋服务器，以及在本应用开发期间给予的全力支持。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**OGS 團隊**](https:\/\/online-go.com\/docs\/team)，感謝他們建立並維護優秀且開放 API 的圍棋伺服器，也感謝他們在應用程式開發期間提供的各項協助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
